{\b Try ArrowKeys}
\par Open ArrowKeys in Applications and allow it in Privacy & Security > Accessibility. In Keyboard > Keyboard Shortcuts > Modifier Keys, set Caps Lock to Option for each keyboard you use. For automatic startup, select Open at Login in the ArrowKeys menu. When upgrading from the Karabiner edition, remove the old ArrowKeys rule in Complex Modifications.
}
